1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
This hall in Beijing hides a secret clock inside its pillars.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,800
Four tall center pillars stand for the four seasons.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,100
Twelve more ring them — one for every month.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,400
And twelve on the outside mark the day's two-hour watches.

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,500
The whole Hall of Prayer, or Qínián Diàn, was built with zero nails.

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,800
So — master calendar, or master carpentry? You decide.
